  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "帮我买一个黄色的吧\n\n小雨：喂，本，我是小雨。\n本：小雨，怎么了？\n小雨：你上次不是说想要个杯子吗？我在逛街，看到这儿有杯子，我买回去给你吧。\n本：好啊，谢谢你！\n小雨：你喜欢什么颜色？\n本：我喜欢红色和绿色。\n小雨：这个杯子没有红色的，绿色的卖完了。现在还有蓝色、紫色和黄色的。\n本：那帮我买一个黄色的吧。\n小雨：好的。\n本：小雨，谢谢你！回来我给你钱。\n小雨：不客气。那我明天把杯子拿给你。\n本：好的。明天见！\n小雨：明天见！",
    "traditional": "幫我買一個黃色的吧\n\n小雨：喂，本，我是小雨。\n本：小雨，怎麼了？\n小雨：你上次不是說想要個杯子嗎？我在逛街，看到這兒有杯子，我買回去給你吧。\n本：好啊，謝謝你！\n小雨：你喜歡什麼顏色？\n本：我喜歡紅色和綠色。\n小雨：這個杯子沒有紅色的，綠色的賣完了。現在還有藍色、紫色和黃色的。\n本：那幫我買一個黃色的吧。\n小雨：好的。\n本：小雨，謝謝你！回來我給你錢。\n小雨：不客氣。那我明天把杯子拿給你。\n本：好的。明天見！\n小雨：明天見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Help me buy a yellow one"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：喂，本，我是小雨。",
      "traditional": "小雨：喂，本，我是小雨。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wéi běn wǒ shì xiǎo yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Hello, Ben, this is Little Yu."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：小雨，怎么了？",
      "traditional": "本：小雨，怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo yǔ zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Yu, what's up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：你上次不是说想要个杯子吗？",
      "traditional": "小雨：你上次不是說想要個杯子嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ shàng cì bú shì shuō xiǎng yào ge bēi zi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我在逛街，看到这儿有杯子，我买回去给你吧。",
      "traditional": "我在逛街，看到這兒有杯子，我買回去給你吧。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zài guàng jiē kàn dào zhè‘r yǒu bēi zi wǒ mǎi huí qù gěi nǐ ba",
      "english": "Little Yu: Last time, didn't you say you wanted a cup?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I'm out window-shopping and found some cups. How about I buy one for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "本：好啊，谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：好啊，謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo a xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Sure, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小雨：你喜欢什么颜色？",
      "traditional": "小雨：你喜歡什麼顏色？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ xǐ huan shén me yán sè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: What colors do you like?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "本：我喜欢红色和绿色。",
      "traditional": "本：我喜歡紅色和綠色。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ xǐ huan hóng sè hé lǜ sè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I like red and green."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小雨：这个杯子没有红色的，绿色的卖完了。",
      "traditional": "小雨：這個杯子沒有紅色的，綠色的賣完了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ zhè ge bēi zi méi yǒu hóng sè de lǜ sè de mài wán le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "现在还有蓝色、紫色和黄色的。",
      "traditional": "現在還有藍色、紫色和黃色的。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài hái yǒu lán sè zǐ sè hé huáng sè de",
      "english": "Little Yu: They don't have this cup in red, and the green one is sold out."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "They still have it in blue, purple and yellow."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "本：那帮我买一个黄色的吧。",
      "traditional": "本：那幫我買一個黃色的吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà bāng wǒ mǎi yí ge huáng sè de ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then buy a yellow one for me."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小雨：好的。",
      "traditional": "小雨：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "本：小雨，谢谢你！回来我给你钱。",
      "traditional": "本：小雨，謝謝你！回來我給你錢。",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo yǔ xiè xie nǐ huí lái wǒ gěi nǐ qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Yu, thank you! I'll give you the money when you come back."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "小雨：不客气。那我明天把杯子拿给你。",
      "traditional": "小雨：不客氣。那我明天把杯子拿給你。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ bú kè qi nà wǒ míng tiān bǎ bēi zi ná gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Don't mention it. Then I'll bring the cup for you tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "本：好的。明天见！",
      "traditional": "本：好的。明天見！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de míng tiān jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, see you tomorrow!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "simplified": "小雨：明天见！",
      "traditional": "小雨：明天見！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ míng tiān jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: See you tomorrow!"
    }
